    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24376" root="صغر" body-key="S">
    
      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استصغرهُ</span></b>  <i>He counted, accounted, reckoned,</i>
or <i>esteemed, him,</i> or <i>it, small,</i> or <i>little:</i> or <i>vile,
base,</i> or <i>ignominious:</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَدَّهُ صَغِيرًا</span>: (S, K:)
or <i>young:</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَغَّرَهُ</span></b> . (TA.)

